/*
Completed - Executed a completion action
Closed - User closed/cleared/hid the message
Expired - Expired (no action)
Opted Out - User opted out of messages of this type
Snoozed - Prompt has not expired and is currently snoozed
Active - Not Expired & Active (as of the Last Viewed Date)
//TO DO: Auto Closed - No longer applicable if NLA date is equal to last viewed date
*/

/* Complete */
IF ( ActOnIt__Completed__c , 'Completed',

/* Closed */
