fields.help:
New: New pending save attempt awaiting outreach from retention specialist;	
Open: Engaged with customer on save attempt. (no action on billing or product side needed now);	
On Hold: Customer has delayed billing for an agreed period of time & temporarily loses access to software;
Saved: Customer is retained and no updates to billing or the product;
Partial Saved: Customer is retained and a new downgrade opportunity is created to adjust the billing & product;	
Lost: Customer has churned

